WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Start with a blank canvas and a connected AI query in Lowcoder Automator.

00:08.000 --> 00:22.000
Ask Automator to create a simple to-do app.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.000
Automator adds native, editable Lowcoder components to the canvas.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.500
The result: a task input, Add task button, status filter and task table.
